00:01:53,520 --> 00:01:57,920
 are quite well behaved. A low carbon steel mild steel for example doesn't really mind being welded.

28
00:01:57,920 --> 00:02:01,920
 It doesn't experience a substantial change in properties or microstructure as a result of the

29
00:02:01,920 --> 00:02:06,000
 intense heat and the resultant cooling that happens when you weld it. But other materials can be

30
00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:10,800
 quite sensitive. High carbon steel is an alloy steels for example need to be welded very carefully.

31
00:02:10,800 --> 00:02:14,960
 High carbon steels for example when rapidly heated and cooled as a result of the welding process

