00:02:14,960 --> 00:02:18,480
 have a tendency to fall on martin site. And the corresponding change in properties that you get

33
00:02:18,480 --> 00:02:22,720
 from areas that are close to the weld that have undergone this kind of unintentional heat treatment

34
00:02:22,720 --> 00:02:26,320
 compared to those that have further away can lead to brittleness and cracking.

35
00:02:26,320 --> 00:02:30,480
 Alloys steels which derive many of their nice properties from the inclusion of specific amounts

