00:03:05,360 --> 00:03:10,400
 hot crack. Here the aluminiums can actually tear open as a result of the rapid expansion and

45
00:03:10,880 --> 00:03:14,640
 subsequent cooling that happens when you weld them. This is why some grades of aluminium that have

